00:03:59.019 --> 00:04:02.879
Just like the Greek Daedalus, Stephen just
wanna create and be free.

00:04:02.879 --> 00:04:08.280
But before he can fly high, he gotta grind
through an earthly prison full of weak ass

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:09.280
chumps.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:12.349
And they ain't no better way to stay fly than
hittin' that subscribe button and gettin'

00:04:12.349 --> 00:04:14.219
you some Thug Notes threads!

00:04:14.219 --> 00:04:16.070
